        "date": "2026-11-08T10:26:50Z"
      },
      "message": "docs: a claim comment is a claim - mirror it as a label, both ways\n\nOnly collaborators can set labels, so anyone else claims an issue by\ncommenting `claimed:` (or `/claim`). AGENTS.md now says the comment is\nthe claim and the label only mirrors it: check comments before claiming,\nlabel an unlabelled comment claim (plus the assignee), and drop the\nlabel when the claim comment is deleted or the claimant says unclaim.\nA contributor's claim stands while its comment exists (no 4 h timer;\nagent claims keep the 4 h rule). /review-prs step 4 now syncs both ways.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>",
