        "date": "2026-11-08T10:28:57Z"
      },
      "message": "docs: a withdrawn claim stays withdrawn; claims match on any line\n\nReview of #281: the Add pass re-found a claimant's old claim comment after\nthey commented unclaim, so Add and Withdraw would flip the label every\nrun. Add now skips a claim comment its author later withdrew, and AGENTS.md\n'Check before claiming' says the same. The pattern now matches a claim on\nany line of a comment, as both texts say. 'Claim before any code' keeps\nthe 4 h stale rule for agent claims only, and 'Pick' drops issues holding\na live contributor claim comment.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>",
